{"bvid": "BV1HBe9zdEMY", "title": "句式结构是突破口语流利度的关键！", "duration": 715, "subs": [{"cid": 31933597556, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 246, "body": [{"content": "大家好，欢迎回到我的频道", "from": 0.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 1, "to": 1.8}, {"content": "我是阿尔伯特", "from": 1.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 2, "to": 3.08}, {"content": "自从上次视频后已经有一段时间没见到大家了", "from": 3.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 3, "to": 6.13}, {"content": "我真的很想念你们", "from": 6.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 4, "to": 7.55}, {"content": "今天在这期视频中，我将谈谈句子结构的重要性", "from": 7.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 5, "to": 11.53}, {"content": "为什么句子结构对提升英语口语至关重要", "from": 11.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 6, "to": 15.41}, {"content": "或者帮助所有人提升英语口语", "from": 15.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 7, "to": 17.45}, {"content": "如果你喜欢这个视频", "from": 17.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 8, "to": 19.05}, {"content": "请给我点个赞并订阅这个频道", "from": 19.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 9, "to": 21.29}, {"content": "这对我的帮助真的很大", "from": 21.29, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 10, "to": 23.31}, {"content": "同时也会帮助很多需要提升的人", "from": 23.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 11, "to": 25.73}, {"content": "那些想提高自己英语口语的人", "from": 25.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 12, "to": 27.99}, {"content": "不多废话", "from": 27.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 13, "to": 29.29}, {"content": "我们直接开始吧，几天前", "from": 29.29, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 14, "to": 32.04}, {"content": "我向许多想提升英语口语的人提问", "from": 32.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 15, "to": 36.52}, {"content": "我只是想了解他们的问题", "from": 36.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 16, "to": 39.56}, {"content": "以便帮助他们解决问题", "from": 39.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 17, "to": 42.02}, {"content": "我只是想知道他们", "from": 42.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 18, "to": 45.1}, {"content": "他们开始说英语时有什么感受", "from": 45.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 19, "to": 48.72}, {"content": "我可以回答他们经常感到卡壳", "from": 48.72, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 52.5}, {"content": "因为他们需要在大脑中进行全部的中文翻译", "from": 52.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 55.62}, {"content": "或者他们常常感到大脑一片空白", "from": 55.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 59.46}, {"content": "因为他们不知道该说什么或想说什么", "from": 59.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 63.45}, {"content": "他们的大脑里有很多想法", "from": 63.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 66.23}, {"content": "却不知道如何用英语表达这些观点或想法", "from": 66.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 71.419}, {"content": "所以这基本上是许多人感到英语口语卡壳的常见原因", "from": 71.419, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 75.789}, {"content": "为什么很多人在说英语时感到停滞", "from": 75.789, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 78.009}, {"content": "在这期视频中，我想给大家一些建议", "from": 78.009, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 81.89}, {"content": "如何通过减少中文思考来提升英语口语", "from": 81.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 87.68}, {"content": "其实我想告诉大家，说英语时思考中文是完全正常的", "from": 87.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 92.64}, {"content": "当你尝试说英语时", "from": 92.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 94.02}, {"content": "因为我们的中文", "from": 94.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 96.21}, {"content": "因为中文是我们的母语", "from": 96.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 97.89}, {"content": "我们依赖中文来理解一切", "from": 97.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 100.55}, {"content": "当你开始学习英语", "from": 100.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 103.29}, {"content": "或说英语时", "from": 103.29, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 104.35}, {"content": "思考中文是正常且可接受的", "from": 104.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 108.33}, {"content": "为了理解内容或含义", "from": 108.33, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 112.71}, {"content": "但如果长期这样做", "from": 112.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 115.05}, {"content": "如果你", "from": 115.05, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 116.63}, {"content": "你正在与说英语的人进行真实对话", "from": 116.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 41, "to": 121.68}, {"content": "你可能会花很长时间思考或回应他人", "from": 121.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 42, "to": 126.92}, {"content": "换句话说我们需要摆脱这种思维模式并转换", "from": 126.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 43, "to": 133.629}, {"content": "转向中文思考", "from": 133.629, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 44, "to": 135.569}, {"content": "转向英语思考", "from": 135.569, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 45, "to": 137.26}, {"content": "并同时回应他人", "from": 137.26, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 46, "to": 140.94}, {"content": "当我们听到问题时", "from": 140.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 47, "to": 142.18}, {"content": "但接下来怎么做", "from": 142.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 48, "to": 145.81}, {"content": "接下来我将分享提升英语口语的技巧", "from": 145.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 49, "to": 149.03}, {"content": "我想讲一个我高中时期亲身经历的故事", "from": 149.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 50, "to": 152.89}, {"content": "如果你之前看过我的视频", "from": 152.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 51, "to": 156.07}, {"content": "你们肯定已经了解这个视频", "from": 156.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 52, "to": 158.51}, {"content": "这个故事的核心内容", "from": 158.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 53, "to": 160.12}, {"content": "但今天我还是想重新讲述这个故事", "from": 160.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 54, "to": 162.52}, {"content": "为了说明句式结构的重要性", "from": 162.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 55, "to": 165.28}, {"content": "所以核心问题在于", "from": 165.28, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 56, "to": 167.2}, {"content": "当我还在读高中时", "from": 167.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 57, "to": 168.61}, {"content": "有四位美国人来到我们学校", "from": 168.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 58, "to": 171.37}, {"content": "给我们做关于他们美国生活的讲座", "from": 171.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 59, "to": 175.559}, {"content": "我当时还是不明白这样做的意义", "from": 175.559, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 60, "to": 178.479}, {"content": "但发生的事情", "from": 178.479, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 61, "to": 180.77}, {"content": "简直太疯狂了", "from": 180.77, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 62, "to": 181.73}, {"content": "因为那时我的英语水平很差", "from": 181.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 185.45}, {"content": "完全听不懂他们在说什么", "from": 185.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 187.62}, {"content": "当他们用英语说话时", "from": 187.62, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 190.04}, {"content": "我尝试了所有方法", "from": 190.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 191.26}, {"content": "我想要理解他们的意思", "from": 191.26, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 193.31}, {"content": "我当时", "from": 193.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 194.03}, {"content": "我在脑海中进行意译", "from": 194.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 196.89}, {"content": "所以归根结底", "from": 196.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 198.97}, {"content": "我大概只听懂了他们说的20%", "from": 198.97, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 203.06}, {"content": "但没关系", "from": 203.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 204.18}, {"content": "因为我尽力了", "from": 204.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 206.44}, {"content": "我确实想听懂他们", "from": 206.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 208.56}, {"content": "因为他们是说英语的美国人", "from": 208.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 211.88}, {"content": "而接下来要和他们互动的人", "from": 211.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 217.12}, {"content": "在我们高中里", "from": 217.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 220.21}, {"content": "英语老师是负责接待他们的", "from": 220.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 78, "to": 224.41}, {"content": "并同意他们的观点", "from": 224.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 79, "to": 226.6}, {"content": "一切都会很顺利", "from": 226.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 80, "to": 228.66}, {"content": "一切都会很顺畅", "from": 228.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 81, "to": 230.56}, {"content": "至少从我们的角度看", "from": 230.56, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 82, "to": 232.1}, {"content": "因为我们都觉得英语老师很优秀", "from": 232.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 83, "to": 236.099}, {"content": "能听懂英语并流利使用", "from": 236.099, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 84, "to": 241.93}, {"content": "所以总的来说", "from": 241.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 85, "to": 242.99}, {"content": "英语老师与美国人交流应该没问题", "from": 242.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 86, "to": 249.91}, {"content": "但当他们交流时", "from": 249.91, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 87, "to": 253.03}, {"content": "发生了非常尴尬的事", "from": 253.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 88, "to": 255.07}, {"content": "一位美国人用中文回应英语老师", "from": 255.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 89, "to": 260.59}, {"content": "他说‘你在说中文’", "from": 260.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 90, "to": 263.03}, {"content": "这非常尴尬", "from": 263.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 91, "to": 264.59}, {"content": "因为我们完全不明白发生了什么", "from": 264.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 92, "to": 267.14}, {"content": "但教室里的所有人都听到了", "from": 267.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 93, "to": 273.94}, {"content": "从这一刻起", "from": 273.94, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 94, "to": 277.36}, {"content": "我开始思考原因", "from": 277.36, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 95, "to": 280.01}, {"content": "我们的英语老师毕生致力于学习英语", "from": 280.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 96, "to": 284.01}, {"content": "但最终却在与", "from": 284.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 97, "to": 290.46}, {"content": "你知道的", "from": 290.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 98, "to": 291.659}, {"content": "说英语的美国人交流时遇到困难", "from": 291.659, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 99, "to": 294.399}, {"content": "不过要公平地说", "from": 294.399, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 100, "to": 295.819}, {"content": "我们的英语老师", "from": 295.819, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 101, "to": 297.179}, {"content": "高中英语老师在英语各个方面都很擅长", "from": 297.179, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 102, "to": 303.2}, {"content": "她擅长语法", "from": 303.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 103, "to": 305.04}, {"content": "她擅长词汇", "from": 305.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 104, "to": 306.8}, {"content": "句子结构和所有内容", "from": 306.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 105, "to": 308.5}, {"content": "但说到英语口语", "from": 308.5, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 106, "to": 310.8}, {"content": "似乎她无法与他人进行对话", "from": 310.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 107, "to": 315.67}, {"content": "这让我突然想到可能语法和词汇其实并不重要", "from": 315.67, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 108, "to": 325.47}, {"content": "在提升英语口语时", "from": 325.47, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 109, "to": 327.69}, {"content": "因为当我们试图参与对话时", "from": 327.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 110, "to": 332.14}, {"content": "一切同时发生", "from": 332.14, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 111, "to": 335.35}, {"content": "真的没有太多时间准备说话", "from": 335.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 112, "to": 338.93}, {"content": "所以我们没有时间组织句子内容", "from": 338.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 113, "to": 344.09}, {"content": "然后就能说出来", "from": 344.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 114, "to": 346.03}, {"content": "所以一切都要提前准备", "from": 346.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 115, "to": 348.659}, {"content": "因此从那时起我开始意识到，仅仅知道语法", "from": 348.659, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 116, "to": 354.03}, {"content": "仅仅掌握词汇", "from": 354.03, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 117, "to": 355.71}, {"content": "不足以说流利的英语", "from": 355.71, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 118, "to": 358.55}, {"content": "肯定还有其他东西", "from": 358.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 119, "to": 360.659}, {"content": "英语口语中缺少了什么", "from": 360.659, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 120, "to": 365.3}, {"content": "那到底是什么", "from": 365.3, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 121, "to": 366.6}, {"content": "从我的角度来看", "from": 366.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 122, "to": 368.06}, {"content": "我认为", "from": 368.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 123, "to": 369.09}, {"content": "尽管我们的英语老师学习英语很久了", "from": 369.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 124, "to": 373.11}, {"content": "她仍然在英语口语上感到卡壳", "from": 373.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 125, "to": 376.7}, {"content": "我认为原因在于她没有", "from": 376.7, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 126, "to": 379.74}, {"content": "没有", "from": 379.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 127, "to": 380.16}, {"content": "你知道的", "from": 380.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 128, "to": 380.98}, {"content": "花大量时间练习英语口语作为最高目标", "from": 380.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 129, "to": 385.12}, {"content": "作为高中英语老师", "from": 385.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 130, "to": 387.09}, {"content": "她的重点是教我们如何记忆词汇", "from": 387.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 131, "to": 390.61}, {"content": "如何理解信息", "from": 390.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 132, "to": 392.79}, {"content": "以及如何轻松通过考试", "from": 392.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 133, "to": 395.64}, {"content": "口语并不被要求", "from": 395.64, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 134, "to": 397.88}, {"content": "所以她没有花太多时间练习口语", "from": 397.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 135, "to": 402.2}, {"content": "因此她无法说流利英语是正常的", "from": 402.2, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 136, "to": 407.12}, {"content": "这完全可以理解", "from": 407.12, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 137, "to": 409.78}, {"content": "但对我来说我一直", "from": 410.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 138, "to": 414.08}, {"content": "从小就想说流利英语", "from": 414.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 139, "to": 415.42}, {"content": "所以我总是想要寻求建议或方法", "from": 415.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 140, "to": 422.04}, {"content": "甚至提升口语的方法", "from": 422.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 141, "to": 425.84}, {"content": "我发现了一项对我帮助很大的事情", "from": 425.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 142, "to": 429.0}, {"content": "在提升我的英语口语时", "from": 429.0, "location"